{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/TitleLogo.png?t=1755305891\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6Free-Placement Tower Defense \u00d7 Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/30a814fd5dd4163aa808e33c23a8d82f.poster.avif?t=1755305891\" width=660 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/30a814fd5dd4163aa808e33c23a8d82f.webm?t=1755305891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free-placement tower defense game where there are no fixed enemy paths, allowing you to place units anywhere.<br>The placement of your units can influence the routes enemies take. Some enemies will attack you, adding enjoyment as you strategize while considering their unique traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/CardChoice.gif?t=1755305891\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battles, you\u2019ll face numerous choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What might be inside the treasure chests you open?\ud83d\udc40</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6Give jobs to your cute companions and take command of the battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/JobChenge.gif?t=1755305891\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u3010Novices\u3011 will fight hard even as they are,<br>but assigning them jobs will make them even more effective.<br>Level them up, and they\u2019ll gain job-specific skills to shine even brighter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1473300?t=1755305891","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/21103f5cca7ecf88e1a686b2f155ebbf438132cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755305891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/1d2e878a02e8aa691d75505b45b4ebbdec641aab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755305891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/1d2e878a02e8aa691d75505b45b4ebbdec641aab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755305891","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/TitleLogo.png?t=1755305891\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6Free-Placement Tower Defense \u00d7 Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/30a814fd5dd4163aa808e33c23a8d82f.poster.avif?t=1755305891\" width=660 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/30a814fd5dd4163aa808e33c23a8d82f.webm?t=1755305891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free-placement tower defense game where there are no fixed enemy paths, allowing you to place units anywhere.<br>The placement of your units can influence the routes enemies take. Some enemies will attack you, adding enjoyment as you strategize while considering their unique traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/CardChoice.gif?t=1755305891\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battles, you\u2019ll face numerous choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What might be inside the treasure chests you open?\ud83d\udc40</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6Give jobs to your cute companions and take command of the battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/extras/JobChenge.gif?t=1755305891\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u3010Novices\u3011 will fight hard even as they are,<br>but assigning them jobs will make them even more effective.<br>Level them up, and they\u2019ll gain job-specific skills to shine even brighter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["HarukanaGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473300/header.jpg?t=1755305891","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1473300/214234748/1a6a81bed7901917c6eaeac9b624d31f578a1283/1754264048/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755305890","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1473300/214234748/1a6a81bed7901917c6eaeac9b624d31f578a1283/1754264048/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755305890","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.